🧩 PART 2: CREATE POWER APPS

✅ Step 1: Create App

In Power Apps:

Create → Canvas App (Tablet)



---

✅ Step 2: Connect Data

Add:

SE Section List

SE Supplier List

SE Question List

SE Evaluation List



---

🧩 PART 3: SECTION DROPDOWN

Insert Dropdown:

Items = 'SE Section List'
Value = "Title"


---

🧩 PART 4: MAIN LAYOUT (VERY IMPORTANT)

Use containers:

MainContainer (Vertical)

   ├── Dropdown_Section
   └── ScrollContainer (Horizontal Scroll)
          ├── HeaderContainer
          └── Gallery_Suppliers


---

🧩 PART 5: SCROLL CONTAINER (KEY PART)

Insert container:

Properties:

Direction = LayoutDirection.Vertical
OverflowX = Overflow.Scroll
OverflowY = Overflow.Hidden

👉 This gives ONE horizontal scroll


---

🧩 PART 6: HEADER (TOP ROW)

Inside HeaderContainer (Horizontal)


---

➤ Add Supplier Header

Text = "Supplier"
Width = 150


---

➤ Add Code Header

Text = "Code"
Width = 120


---

➤ Add Dynamic Question Header

Insert Horizontal Gallery

Name:

Gallery_Header

Items:

Filter(
    'SE Question List',
    Section.Id = Dropdown_Section.Selected.ID
)


---

Inside:

Text = ThisItem.Title


---

Set column width:

TemplateSize = 110


---

🧩 PART 7: SUPPLIER ROWS

Insert Vertical Gallery

Name:

Gallery_Suppliers

Items:

Filter(
    'SE Supplier List',
    Section.Id = Dropdown_Section.Selected.ID
)


---

🧩 PART 8: BUILD ROW CONTENT

Inside each row → insert Horizontal Container


---

➤ Supplier Name

Text = ThisItem.Title
Width = 150


---

➤ Supplier Code

Text = ThisItem.'Supplier Code'
Width = 120


---

➤ Questions (Columns)

Insert Horizontal Gallery

Name:

Gallery_Questions_H


---

Items:

Filter(
    'SE Question List',
    Section.Id = Dropdown_Section.Selected.ID
)


---

Column Width:

TemplateSize = 110


---

🧩 PART 9: RADIO BUTTON (DYNAMIC)

Inside Gallery_Questions_H

Insert Radio:

Name:

Radio_Score


---

Items:

Sequence(ThisItem.'Max Score')


---

Make horizontal:

Layout = Layout.Horizontal


---

Prevent scroll:

Width = Parent.TemplateWidth


---

🧩 PART 10: FIX SCROLL (IMPORTANT)


---

Header Width:

HeaderContainer.Width =
150 + 120 + (CountRows(Gallery_Header.AllItems) * 110)


---

Rows Width:

Gallery_Suppliers.Width = HeaderContainer.Width


---

Remove inner scroll:

Gallery_Header.ShowScrollbar = false
Gallery_Questions_H.ShowScrollbar = false


